' S-571 (2026-10-16): the arguments of a METHOD call reach the callee on every engine, also through a virtual
' call. The JS backend passed them as a bare operand list while its runtime expects ONE array and silently
' replaced anything else with an empty list (every method parameter was undefined).
CLASS Calc
    PUBLIC
    METHOD Add(a AS I32, b AS I32) AS I32
        RETURN a + b
    END METHOD
    VIRTUAL METHOD Scale(a AS I32) AS I32
        RETURN a * 2
    END METHOD
END CLASS
CLASS Calc3 EXTENDS Calc
    PUBLIC
    OVERRIDE METHOD Scale(a AS I32) AS I32
        RETURN a * 3
    END METHOD
END CLASS
DIM c AS Calc = NEW Calc3()
PRINT c.Add(5, 6)
PRINT c.Scale(7)
